      "released": "2024-12-25T00:00:01.000Z",
      "overview": "On the 31st of October 2021, a short Stormester special was broadcast in two parts, during the Knæk Cancer Live telethon, to raise money for the fight against cancer. Knæk Cancer (‘Break Cancer’) is an annual week of television broadcast in Denmark on TV2, usually in October, which culminates in a live charity telethon. Knæk Cancer’s flower logo (or ‘Knæk Cancer-blomst’) is an iconic emblem, and easily recognised by all Danes. The special featured just three contestants, who had to create the second-biggest Knæk Cancer flower, and a portrait of one of their fellow contestants using items no-one else has used. The studio segments of this special were filmed at The Glass Hall in the Tivoli Gardens amusement park.",
